cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "A Synthetic SAP-Structured FP&A Dataset with Plan Versions"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Kumar"
    given-names: "Ajay"
    affiliation: "Indian Institute of Information Technology Dharwad"
  - family-names: "Khaire"
    given-names: "Utkarsh"
    affiliation: "Indian Institute of Information Technology Dharwad"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible synthetic dataset for financial planning and analysis research,
  combining SAP-style double-entry transactional actuals with budget and rolling
  forecast plan versions across four fiscal years (FY2022-FY2025). 159,934 postings
  across 79,967 documents; 22,656 planning rows; 236 cost-centre x G/L-account
  forecasting series. Generated deterministically from seed 42 and shipped with a
  16-check deterministic acceptance suite. No real company, client, or SAP customer
  data were used at any stage.
keywords:
  - financial planning and analysis
  - synthetic data
  - enterprise resource planning
  - time series forecasting
  - benchmark dataset
  - SAP
